OL,3,GNEWSACrews facing 'very challenging'
OL,4,Ablaze at scrap metal facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are expected to remain at
OL,7,Fthe scene of a fire in east Belfast's
OL,8,Fdock area through the night.
OL,10,FThe blaze, which saw smoke pour from
OL,11,Fscrap metal recycling facility Clearway
OL,12,FDisposals, was reported shortly after
OL,13,Fmidday on Wednesday.
OL,15,FMore than 50 firefighters then worked
OL,16,Fovernight to control the blaze, which
OL,17,Fearlier in the day forced a cruise ship
OL,18,Fto leave early.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
